sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User / Client
    participant AC as adoption.controller
    participant P as Pet model
    participant AD as Adoption model
    participant N as Notification model
    participant MA as Admin middleware
    participant MCA as admin.controller

    U->>AC: POST /api/adoptions { pet, fullName, phone, address, ... }
    AC->>AC: required fields + valid ObjectId
    AC->>P: Pet.findById(pet)
    P-->>AC: not found -> 404
    AC->>AC: status "available" and !adopted? else 400
    AC->>AD: findOne({ pet, user, status: "Pending" }) duplicate? -> 400
    AC->>AD: Adoption.create({ user: req.user.id, ... })
    AC-->>U: 201 { adoption (Pending) }

    Note over U,MA: Administrator reviews request
    MA->>MA: protect + adminOnly
    MA->>MCA: PUT /api/adoptions/:id { status }
    MCA->>AD: findById + populate pet
    MCA->>AD: adoption.status = status, save
    MCA->>P: if Approved: update pet { adopted: true, status: "adopted" }
    MCA->>N: Notification.create({ user: applicant, type: "adoption", ... })
    MCA-->>MA: 200 { adoption }
    U->>U: applicant sees decision via GET /notifications